<title>USA: Bayerische Landesbank-NY sets $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Bayerische Landesbank-NY sets $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Wednesday, said lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>BORROWER BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK-NY</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.00 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/1998</p>
<p>TYPE DEPOSIT NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE N.A. LAST MOODY AAA     SPREAD +9 BP	PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P   AAA     YIELD 6.00 PCT    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>Bayerische Landesbank Girozentrale affiliate.</p>
<p>--Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
